+### Deployment AI Gateway models
+
+An administrator can publish models from the **AI providers** page. Workshop stores no upstream
+keys: configure keys and providers in Cloudflare AI Gateway, then enter the exact one-segment
+provider route after the gateway ID, the upstream model ID, and its relative Chat Completions path.
+For example, native OpenRouter uses provider route `openrouter` and path `chat/completions`, which
+routes to `https://gateway.ai.cloudflare.com/v1/<account>/<gateway>/openrouter/chat/completions`.
+A custom provider with slug `acme` instead uses provider route `custom-acme`. These deployment
+models always use the deployment gateway rather than a connected user's personal gateway.
